Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Mga Direktor: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Reyna ng Luha{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Nasaan ang pera? Humihingi kami ng kabayaran sa aming lupa!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyayari?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit sila kumikilos\Nkapag tayo ang biktima dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.17,0:01:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Babayaran sa lupa?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mawawala lahat ng kaguluhan kung uuwi tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.37,0:01:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumalik tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan tayo pupunta, kung hindi sa bahay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kami makakapunta sa isang hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, ang back gate ay\Nempty. Maaari kang pumunta dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.40,0:01:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ang pinakamahusay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumalik. Sumakay sa likod ng gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Darating ba sila?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.12,0:02:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan natin kung ano ang magagawa mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nagiging\Ndirt-poor ang isang conglomerate family at pinalayas."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Narito na sila!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo? Buksan ang gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, kailangan mong lumabas saglit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito? Pagod na ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.86,0:02:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba na si Chairman Hong\Ngave Ms. Moh ang power of attorney...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,para pamahalaan ang lahat sa Queens Town...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,sa panahon ng kanyang pagkawala?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinapaalis ba niya tayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi talaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.58,0:02:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil sa kung paano dumarami ang lugar na ito...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,na may mga reporter at nagpoprotesta,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,gusto niyang humiga ka hanggang sa mamuo ang alikabok.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.13,0:03:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,May karapatan ba siyang gawin\Nyon? Lahat kami ay residente dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, pwede ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.85,0:03:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag makisali kapag nag-uusap ang mga matatanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo gets, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.45,0:03:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.53,0:03:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mga sasakyan ng kumpanya, driver,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,mga telepono, at credit card ay hindi na sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi rin gagana ang mga security card ng iyong kumpanya\Nand key card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin? Ito ang aking tahanan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumawag ng pulis, Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tawagan mo sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Magugustuhan ito ng mga reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Dahil sa ating kasaysayang magkasama,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-pack up ako ng ilang mahahalagang bagay para sa iyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya sige na.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano yun?\N- Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumasok! May mga camera sa kabilang side!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hindi ba ito walang katotohanan, Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Paano si Seul-hee...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}i-lock ang mga pinto at sipain kami...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.41,0:04:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ng tahanan ng ating ama?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Maaari mong igiit ang iyong mga karapatan\Nas mga residente ng tahanan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ngunit dapat kang magsampa ng kaso,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}at magtatagal ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ngunit ang pinakamalaking isyu ay,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ang chairman ay nagsama ng convertible\Nrights clause sa kontrata,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.57,0:04:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}at ilagay ang kanyang pamilya bilang joint surety,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}kaya ang iyong real estate, stocks,\Nand personal bank accounts...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ay lahat ay nagyelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sus, Ama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Maghintay. Totoo ba ito, Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hindi ko rin alam. Naguguluhan din ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lip balm, kahit sino?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lip balm, paa ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas mabuti na ang media\N ay hindi mag-post ng mga larawan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dadalhin kita sa isang lugar na ligtas, at\Nmaiisip natin ang susunod nating plano doon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ang tahimik ni Soo-cheol?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, Soo-cheol! Magsabi ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya ang asawa mo, Da-hye, ay\Nin din dito. tama ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinabi ko? Hindi siya hinahabol ni Geon-u\N!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya nga pala, saan tayo pupunta?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano yun?\N- Ano yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sino ang bumubulag sa atin?\N- Sino yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Teka.\N- Sino yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay pribadong pag-aari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Si Hyun-woo ba yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.67,0:05:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, Hyun-woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam na darating ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Itay, ito ay apurahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, Hyun-woo. Bakit hindi mo sinundo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka ba kumakain ng maayos?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.45,0:06:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakatakot ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi, ito ay...\N- Huwag kang mabalisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.24,0:06:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Natutuwa akong iniwan mo ang baliw na pamilyang iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan kung ano ang nangyari sa\Nkanila pagkatapos ka nilang paalisin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang Karma ay palaging makakahanap ng paraan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tahan na...\N- Pustahan ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakagaan ng loob ko sa narinig...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,na nasira ang pamilya. Nagsisilbi sa kanila ng tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, kalimutan mo na yan\Nsly fox and live a happy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Narito rin ang tusong fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nandito ka rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi lang siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang biyenan mo. Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,, "dating biyenan" ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway... Ano ang nagdadala sa iyo dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.79,0:07:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta ka na?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello.\N- Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Humihingi ako ng paumanhin sa pagdating ko nang hindi ipinaalam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala tungkol dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Natutuwa akong nandito ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Paki-follow ako. Sa ganitong paraan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Babalik ako sa Seoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.93,0:07:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mag-taxi.\N- Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.31,0:08:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang mga taksi dito sa ganitong oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay hahanap ako ng ibang paraan, kaya gawin mo ang gusto mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nandito na kami, pero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi ko na sayo na ayaw kong sumama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang mali?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingin ko natapakan niya ang dumi ng baka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay, huwag kang sumama. Huwag kang lumapit sa akin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mo rin akong lalapitan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mabuti naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, Hyeon-tae.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.27,0:09:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Marami akong napili.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano ko ito maiintindihan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.05,0:09:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.07,0:09:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit dito dinala ni Hyun-woo ang kanyang dating asawa\Nand ang kanyang pamilya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Katulad ito sa Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring mayroong North at South,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,pero nasa\Nsame team pa rin kami sa Olympics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong sinasabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagkakapit-bisig kami kapag may isang karaniwang kaaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibig sabihin ba nito ay maaaring magkabalikan sila?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring nasa iisang team kami, ngunit\Nhindi iyon ginagarantiyahan ng unification.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Maghanda na tayo.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang mali?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat sa araw na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghahanap ako ng bagong mapupuntahan bukas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang magbabago...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,magdamag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko. Higit pang dahilan\Nhindi tayo dapat manatili rito.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay magtatagal hanggang sa mamuo ang alikabok.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang pinakaligtas at pinaka\Nkomportableng lugar na maaari mong puntahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi para sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasa bahay ako ng dati kong biyenan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.98,0:10:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ikaw. Ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay kumportable para sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayaan mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.61,0:10:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,maging makasarili sa ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Marami akong nasa plato ngayon...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,para mag-alala din sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang mag-alala sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Naghiwalay kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Anuman ang mangyari sa akin...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.37,0:11:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,o aking pamilya...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,walang kinalaman sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Titigil na ako sa pag-aalala...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.43,0:11:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,kapag magaling ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit sa ngayon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,imposible yan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya pakiusap...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,intindihin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Basta...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.41,0:11:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,manatili sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo ba magkasama...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,sa sitwasyong ito mas magiging masaya tayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Magiging hindi gaanong miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.01,0:12:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag masyadong mag-isip para sa araw na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus na lang tayo sa pagiging less miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Inalis ko ang mga tipak. Tungkol naman sa amoy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Magtatagal bago matuyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.71,0:12:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Itapon mo na lang.\N- Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Para saan? Mukha silang mahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.59,0:12:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Isuot ang mga ito sa ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano ang mga takong na ito?\NSAt ko bang itapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaalis ba niya ang mga ito, o hindi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukhang mahal sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.42,0:13:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Higit sa $500.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,$5000?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako pumunta dito sa pamamagitan ng pagpili.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakabilis ng anak mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Praktikal niya kaming inagaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.42,0:14:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang yumao kong ina...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi niya, "Hindi mo alam\Nkung ano ang hinaharap."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang nakakaalam na magkikita tayong muli ilang\Naraw pagkatapos nating mag-bid ng ating huling paalam?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinihikayat kami ng kapatid ko na manatili\Nat sa kanyang villa sa Namhae.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Aalis muna tayo sa umaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.15,0:14:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo naman,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit huwag masyadong kumpiyansa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pakikain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Masarap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Angkop ba ito sa iyong panlasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, napakasarap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumain ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mong bawasan ang sodium.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.89,0:15:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Papagalitan ka ni Doctor Yoon\Pag nalaman niya. Wag mong kainin yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala. Hindi niya sinasagot ang mga tawag ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he blocked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:16:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi ka kumakain, Soo-cheol?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako nagugutom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,May tubig ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Eto na.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.55,0:16:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sealed water lang ang iniinom ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.43,0:16:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayroon ka bang bottled water?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Uy, inumin mo na lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, mayroon kami sa tindahan. magdadala ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat. Mas gusto ko ang mineral\Ntubig mula sa Alps, pakiusap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin? Ang Alps?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako makapaniwala sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Humihingi ako ng paumanhin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Immature pa siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, okay lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiintindihan namin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito kailangang mula sa Alps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda ang Germany o Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay din ang Fiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kami masyadong mapili.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, ayos lang din ako sa kanila.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Inom ka lang sa kettle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kukunin ko yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- Hindi, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi niya ako tinatamaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.21,0:17:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakita mo bang sinaktan niya ang kapatid niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Natakot ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin? Sinaktan mo rin ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, hindi naman ganoon kasakit ang mga sampal ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit si Hae-in ay ganap na...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat ba akong tumulong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi mo kailangang tumulong. Magpahinga ka lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nga pala, Hae-in...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.45,0:18:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,May sasabihin ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit hiwalay na kayong dalawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, kaya mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wag mong isapuso ang sinabi ko kanina.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Alin noon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tungkol sa iyong pagiging tuso na fox at lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.59,0:18:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tama.\N- Hindi ko kailanman naayawan ang mga tusong fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tutal, iyon ang palayaw ko noong high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukha akong fox, alam mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong humingi ng paumanhin sa\Npagsasabing nasira ang pamilya mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Totoo naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.56,0:18:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang madamdaming paksa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong hiwalay na kayo,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,pero pumayag ka bang pumunta dito...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil may feelings kayo sa isa't isa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang emergency. Wala na.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Estranghero na kayo ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Higit pa kami diyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero may something ba sa inyo...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.87,0:18:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi sana kami nagdivorce kung ganoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Totoo iyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya mangyaring huwag intindihin, asahan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,o bigyan ng kahulugan ang alinman sa mga ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayoko. Naaalala mo si So-yeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Anak ng principal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakatrabaho siya kamakailan\Nat isang middle school sa malapit,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,at hinihingi ang numero ni Hyun-woo,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- pero hindi ko masabi sa kanya.\N- Kaya mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pwede ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit muli, hindi ko na kailangang humingi ng pahintulot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Magandang gabi, kung gayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi na sila magkakabalikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, ayoko din niyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakabastos niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya nag-abalang marinig\N ako at patuloy akong pinutol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, ang tusong fox na iyon. Hindi siya dapat dumating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang aming annex.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Dito kami nakatira dati\NHyeon-tae at Mi-seon...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.48,0:19:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,nagpakasal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinainit namin ang sahig.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikinalulungkot ko ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.40,0:20:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag humingi ng tawad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit kapitbahay tumulong...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.07,0:20:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,kapag mahirap ang panahon,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,pero kami...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,dating pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.62,0:20:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi sa akin ni Hyun-woo na sikreto na nandito ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Binalaan ko na ang mga taganayon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi gumamit ng internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang CCTV camera sa paligid,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.84,0:20:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,at halos walang gumagamit ng smartphone dito,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.51,0:20:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya huwag mag-alala, at matulog ng mahimbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, wala lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang maghugas dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ang batya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang isa,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,pero eto na ang shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan ako maliligo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.58,0:21:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Paano naman ang bath bomb ko?\N- Huwag mo na itong gamitin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari mong gamitin ang tuwalya na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Unang Kaarawan ni Baek Ho-yeol{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ba sinabing Ho-yeol ang pangalan ng pamangkin mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, Baek Ho-yeol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Itong "baby Ho-yeol" ay hindi maaaring...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.02,0:21:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,yung batang nakita ko kanina diba?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.20,0:21:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Napakaliit niya noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakaganda niya. Oo, ito siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya iisang tao lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon ilang taon na itong tuwalya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.04,0:21:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang mali? Gusto mo ba ng bago?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,ano ang mas hindi kapani-paniwala\Nkaysa sa walong taong gulang na tuwalya na ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:22:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Iniwan ako nina Da-hye at Geon-u,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.11,0:22:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,at Yoon Eun-sung, niloko ako ng jerk na yun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.87,0:22:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyayari?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.04,0:22:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ang lahat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.25,0:22:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ang pamilya ni Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.05,0:22:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.05,0:22:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigurado akong nasa isang lugar sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.09,0:22:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo ginawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.51,0:22:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang manatili sila, kung ganoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.80,0:22:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano tayo mabubuhay...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.35,0:22:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,sa ilalim ng parehong bubong ng mga ninakaw natin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.85,0:22:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pa tapos.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.27,0:22:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Susubukan nilang hanapin ang iyong kahinaan,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.81,0:22:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,at gumanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.61,0:22:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat ay pinaglapit mo lang sila...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.24,0:22:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.65,0:22:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,gusto lang lapitan si Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalimutan mo siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.45,0:22:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You will, eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.03,0:22:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang magsisisi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.58,0:22:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumira ako dito sa loob ng 25 taon,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,pero ito ang unang pagkakataon na makakapili ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.83,0:23:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,aking sariling alak.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.59,0:23:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Simulan nating tamasahin kung ano ang mayroon tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.09,0:23:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Naaalala mo ba ang sinabi mo noong pinaalis mo ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.18,0:23:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Huwag kalimutan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.01,0:23:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mahal na mahal kita,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.81,0:23:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}kaya mananatili akong matatag at titiisin,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.35,0:23:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}kahit na miss kita...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.61,0:23:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}at gusto kang makita,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.11,0:23:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}dahil lang mahal kita.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At tinupad mo ang iyong salita.\NMagaling ka dito.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.45,0:23:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka kailanman na-curious kung paano\Nung anak mo sa ibang bansa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.62,0:23:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You never bothered to call.\NTiis mo talaga lahat,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,pero nakikita mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Napagtanto ko na ito ay isang kasinungalingan...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,upang tiisin ang isang bagay dahil sa pagmamahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.05,0:23:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo matiis...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.51,0:23:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,kung talagang mahal mo ang isang tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nakukuha mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.23,0:24:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinasabi mo bang...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.81,0:24:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,galit ka na sa akin ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.97,0:24:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.98,0:24:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinasabi ko sa iyo na ibabalik ko\NHae-in dito sa lahat ng gastos.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.03,0:24:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako katulad mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.61,0:24:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nababaliw akong magtaka\Nkung nasaan siya, at kung ano ang ginagawa niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.16,0:24:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.83,0:24:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,, tiisin mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba kung gaano kahirap\Nit ang umabot sa ganito?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.75,0:24:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit sa tingin mo ginagawa ko ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kami pareho ng layunin,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.22,0:24:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya kung paano mo pinili ang pamilyang ito kaysa sa akin,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari din akong pumili...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.27,0:24:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,iba pa sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.20,0:25:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Suriin ang lahat ng hotel at villa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.92,0:25:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang buhay na impiyerno.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.13,0:25:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong uri ng impiyerno ang nag-aalok sa atin ng silk blanket...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.38,0:25:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,at isang mainit na sahig?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.82,0:25:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pabayaan mo siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.74,0:25:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay lubos na nabalisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.03,0:25:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pa siya natutulog sa matitigas na sahig dati.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.70,0:25:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Matutulog lang siya sa Spanish royal bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.25,0:25:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukhang mas makapal ang atin kaysa sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.05,0:25:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Magpalit tayo ng kumot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.05,0:25:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.01,0:25:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.09,0:26:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.60,0:26:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,First time ko ding matulog sa sahig.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.81,0:26:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Galing din ako sa mayamang pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.57,0:26:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.45,0:26:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Beom-seok.\N- {\i1}Nakita ko ang balita.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.95,0:26:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kumusta ang lahat?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.87,0:26:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang kabuuang gulo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.21,0:26:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiinis ako kay Itay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.42,0:26:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ibinababa ko ang tawag kung tungkol ito sa kanya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.42,0:26:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag ganito.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.30,0:26:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Naaalala mo ba ang sinabi niya?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sinabi niya sa akin na huwag akong pumunta sa kanyang libing,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.97,0:26:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kaya huwag mo akong tawagan, kahit na mamatay siya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.56,0:26:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika. Wag kang ganito.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.02,0:26:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagalit ako sa kanya noong malusog siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.36,0:26:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,pero ngayong may sakit siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.23,0:26:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Na-guilty ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.24,0:26:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Para saan?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.07,0:27:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Siguro naging okay ang lahat...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.45,0:27:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,kung tinatrato ko ng mabuti si Seul-hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.21,0:27:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Siguro nagalit siya dahil minamaltrato ko siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.34,0:27:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mga sampung taon na ang nakalipas,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.71,0:27:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Napahiya ako nang sabihin sa akin ni Ama...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.84,0:27:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,gusto niyang maging legal na asawa niya,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.42,0:27:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya sumuko siya sa ideyang iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.63,0:27:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Siguro nagtanim siya ng sama ng loob at pinagplanuhan ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.68,0:27:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Itong hangal na singsing. Ito ay wala.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.39,0:27:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat hinayaan ko na lang siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.27,0:27:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibalik ko ba ito sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.94,0:27:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibibigay ko ba sa kanya ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.16,0:27:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Beom-ja.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.87,0:27:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Parang ako ang may kasalanan\N sa nangyari kay Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.55,0:28:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka umiiyak? Iniwan ka ba ng asawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.43,0:28:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi.\N- Tapos may sakit ba parents mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.44,0:28:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.86,0:28:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,May sakit ang tatay ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.15,0:28:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, mahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.65,0:28:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Normal lang na makonsensya...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.57,0:28:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,kapag nagkasakit ang magulang mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.41,0:28:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.41,0:28:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ilabas mo ang lahat at simulan mo siyang tratuhin nang mas mabuti.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.25,0:28:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Magiging maayos ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.00,0:28:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.84,0:28:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.63,0:28:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, ano ang gagawin ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.14,0:28:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang problema?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.01,0:28:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,May isang baliw na tinatawag akong "Nanay" at sinusundan ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.42,0:28:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.48,0:28:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari mo bang sabihin sa kanya na ikaw ang aking anak?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.44,0:29:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.86,0:29:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huli na para lumabas.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.45,0:29:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Ito ang aking ina,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.00,0:29:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- kaya go on your way.\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.00,0:29:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Anak niya ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.29,0:29:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya umalis ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.96,0:29:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Diba taga Seoul ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.51,0:29:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ang nanay ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.26,0:29:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, akin siya!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.43,0:29:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay, hindi ka ba manonood ng drama?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang drama?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.69,0:29:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hindi ko kayang laktawan iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.81,0:29:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tara na, anak ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.74,0:29:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang soap opera.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.66,0:29:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.99,0:29:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.38,0:30:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Must've Been Love{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.80,0:30:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Magkapareho kami ng taste ni Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.73,0:30:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Natutulog ka ba?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.79,0:30:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Malapit na ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.42,0:30:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Bakit?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.84,0:30:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kailangan kong pumasok ng maaga bukas,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.46,0:30:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}para hindi na kita makita...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.93,0:30:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Maaga papasok bukas.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.14,0:30:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kailan ka uuwi...?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.06,0:31:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Okay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.28,0:31:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Dapat ba akong mag-alis bukas?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.28,0:31:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Pwede bang mag-alis ka na lang bukas?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.93,0:31:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Magandang gabi.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.18,0:31:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Pakikinggan ko ang mga kanta\Non your MP3 bago ako matulog.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.24,0:31:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Iyon? Kumusta ang mga kanta?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.19,0:31:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Lahat sila ay oldies.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.82,0:31:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Gusto ko sila.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.32,0:31:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Lahat sila ay paborito kong kanta.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.45,0:31:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hindi akin ang MP3 na iyon.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.07,0:31:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Tapos?\N- Kinuha ko ito dati.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.99,0:31:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hindi ko mahanap ang may-ari,\Nkaya itinago ko ito sa akin habang-buhay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.79,0:31:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Saan mo ito nakita?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.95,0:32:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sa high school ko.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.04,0:32:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nasa field.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hindi ka ba nag-aral sa Hanil Foreign\NLanguage High School?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.29,0:32:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Oo, kinuha ko ito sa unang araw ko doon.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.07,0:32:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.86,0:32:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So akin ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.99,0:32:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Maghintay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.85,0:33:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Iyon ay...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.23,0:33:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.98,0:33:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kapani-paniwala.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.48,0:33:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibig kong sabihin...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.78,0:33:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isinilang ba siya...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.57,0:33:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,mahalin ako o ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.91,0:33:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahulog siya sa akin sa maikling sandaling iyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.12,0:33:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya iningatan niya ito sa lahat ng oras na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.79,0:33:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Magugulat siya kapag\Nnalaman niya ang babaeng minahal niya...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.62,0:33:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,ay ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.80,0:33:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ngunit bakit mayroon ka pa rin nito?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.55,0:33:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Napakaganda niya siguro.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.14,0:33:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano...?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.64,0:33:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.02,0:33:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.57,0:33:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,tandaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.40,0:33:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayaw mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.82,0:33:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.91,0:34:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ay ilang taon na ang nakalipas.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.53,0:34:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,, Eksakto.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.04,0:34:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang katotohanang pinanatili mo pa rin\Nito sa lahat ng mga taon na ito ay nangangahulugan na...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.96,0:34:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi mo siya maalis sa isip mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.84,0:34:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Siguradong napakaganda niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.05,0:34:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika. Hindi naman ganun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.97,0:34:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko na maalala...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.14,0:34:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,kung lalaki ang tao,\Nbabae, guro, estudyante,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.93,0:34:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,o isang security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong maalala.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.94,0:34:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon bakit pa rin ito itinatago?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko ito iniingatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.49,0:34:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Itinago ko lang ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.83,0:34:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Maaari kang pumunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.54,0:34:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go. Matulog ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.55,0:34:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.84,0:35:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang kurtina.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.47,0:35:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiyaking iguguhit mo ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.35,0:35:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang silid na ito ay nakaharap sa silangan,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.72,0:35:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya medyo maliwanag sa umaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.77,0:35:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, kaya umalis ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.28,0:38:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat ba akong tumulong?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.62,0:38:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.83,0:38:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gagawin ko ang ilang {\i1}japchae.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.66,0:38:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari mo bang i-chop itong mga carrots para sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.88,0:38:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.38,0:38:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetie, mag-ingat na huwag putulin ang iyong mga daliri.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.64,0:38:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mong julienne ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaano ka manipis ang gusto mong tadtarin ko sila?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.81,0:38:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... Ito ay...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.06,0:38:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayaan mong ipakita ko sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.12,0:39:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Inay.\N- Oo?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.88,0:39:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ay hindi kapani-paniwala.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.42,0:39:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang hindi kapani-paniwala tungkol dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.51,0:39:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano mo nasabi iyan? Ito ay parang...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.76,0:39:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,modernong sining.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.22,0:39:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.22,0:39:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.64,0:39:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ay bago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.44,0:39:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumagawa ka ng {\i1}japchae,{\i0} tama?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.40,0:39:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano pa ang kailangan mong gawin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.90,0:39:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Susunod...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.74,0:39:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan kong magluto ng ilang itlog.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.65,0:39:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Paano mo eksaktong ginagawa iyon?\N- Ang mga itlog?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.82,0:39:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang cakewalk. Dapat ko bang ipakita sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.99,0:39:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Excited na ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.79,0:39:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakamangha mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.17,0:39:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagagamit ko ang dalawang kamay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.97,0:39:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan, Ina.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.39,0:39:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakamangha ka talaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.01,0:39:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ba? Dapat ko bang iikot din ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.43,0:39:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.06,0:40:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagbibiro lang ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.81,0:40:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ang pagbabago ng puso?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.06,0:40:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi mo bakante ang villa mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.82,0:40:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang mali? Tutol ba ang asawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.90,0:40:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung sakaling malaman ng mga reporter?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.03,0:40:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya makapaniwala.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.83,0:40:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang tumulong sa kanya tuwing\Nang kanyang negosyo ay bumagsak?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.62,0:40:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano niya magagawa ito sa\Naking asawa, sa lahat ng tao?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.75,0:40:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalimutan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.75,0:40:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kapani-paniwala.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.84,0:40:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Narito ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.71,0:40:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinanap kita kahit saan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.93,0:40:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.47,0:40:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Malinis na sila ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.39,0:40:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala silang amoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.31,0:40:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.47,0:40:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- Meron kung gusto mo.\N- Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.94,0:40:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit napakamahal ng mga ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.27,0:40:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang. sa iyo sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.07,0:40:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon bakit hindi mo ako hayaang mag-ayos ng iyong buhok?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.49,0:40:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakahusay ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.62,0:41:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong uri ng hairstyle ang gusto mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.62,0:41:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang magagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.54,0:41:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.05,0:41:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagtatrabaho ako dati sa Cheongdam-dong, alam mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.80,0:41:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi-seon, anong nangyayari?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.60,0:41:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang pinakamagandang twist kailanman\Nmula sa "The Sixth Sense."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.72,0:41:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Pati ang mga palad ko ay pawis na.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.81,0:41:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hoy...\N- Ang sama ng bibig mo sa tusong fox na yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.53,0:41:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos narinig ko na bigla siyang sumulpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.94,0:41:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nangyayari lang yan sa mga pelikula o drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.77,0:41:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas nakakakilig ito kaysa sa anumang pagtatapos ng drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.86,0:41:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oo.\N- Ano ang nangyari?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.65,0:41:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, mamaya na tayo mag-usap.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.99,0:41:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Balita ko psychopath ang nanay ni Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.78,0:41:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin? kalokohan lang yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.45,0:41:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go!\N- Teka!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.08,0:41:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako aalis. Sinabi sa akin ng asawa ko ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.25,0:41:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig kong natapakan niya\Ndung sa sandaling dumating siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.00,0:41:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,at sumigaw ng ilog.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.80,0:42:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakabaliw. Paano siya makakahakbang\Non dung sa sandaling dumating siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.14,0:42:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Maging prangka tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.35,0:42:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ang nanay mo ang tumapak sa dumi.\N- Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.48,0:42:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dating in-laws sila na\Nended things on a bad note.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.27,0:42:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumakas ang mahihirap na pamilyang iyon\Ning hatinggabi,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.02,0:42:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,at kinailangan silang kunin ni Ms. Jeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.53,0:42:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, nakita ko ang balita. Wala na sila sa kanilang mga pangalan ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.07,0:42:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring mukhang matigas ang nanay mo,\Npero napakalambot niya sa puso.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.91,0:42:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oo.\N- Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.04,0:42:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nga pala, di ba napakawalanghiya ng babaeng yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.83,0:42:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare she pumunta dito pagkatapos ng kanyang ginawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.50,0:42:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tama.\N- Alam mo kung ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.34,0:42:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong makita ang mukha niya kahit minsan lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.92,0:42:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.01,0:42:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? May dumi ba sa labi ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.81,0:42:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay tingnan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.35,0:42:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo akong makita, kaya tingnan mong mabuti.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.61,0:42:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Naka-freeze lang ang aming mga asset sa ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.61,0:42:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kami dumi-mahirap.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.99,0:43:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bagaman gabi na nang dumating kami,\Nhindi kami tumakas sa kalagitnaan ng gabi,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.40,0:43:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,at malapit na tayong umalis.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.49,0:43:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi namin sila kinukulit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.04,0:43:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiintindihan mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.62,0:43:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oo.\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.88,0:43:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.21,0:43:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang kinukuha mo sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.84,0:43:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.43,0:43:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.39,0:43:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka nag-almusal.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.10,0:43:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinadala ko ang mga ito sa taniman.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.22,0:43:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang cold-bean-soup noodles\Nare masarap at nakakapresko.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.64,0:43:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.07,0:43:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong carbs sa araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.45,0:43:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus. Saka kailan mo sila makukuha?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.30,0:44:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang pakiramdam mo sa\Npagiging pinakabatang chairman?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.35,0:44:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang plano mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.14,0:44:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Iba ba ito sa\Nnaunang pamamahala?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.29,0:44:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,May alingawngaw ng malakihang\Nrestructuring. totoo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.23,0:44:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta si Chairman Hong?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.65,0:44:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Plano kong magtatag ng\Nkorporasyon sa Singapore sa 2025,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.61,0:44:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,para makapag-branch out tayo sa mga foreign market.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.33,0:44:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Aabutin kami ng humigit-kumulang $140 milyon para maitatag...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.70,0:44:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,at patakbuhin ang korporasyong ito\Nna magsisilbing pundasyon...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.29,0:44:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa mga department store at supermarket sa ibang bansa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.54,0:44:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Binisita ko si Mr. Song sa\Npenitentiary at nakausap ko siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.46,0:44:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi niya yata alam kung nasaan\N ang secret fund ng chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.26,0:44:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nilikha niya ang pondo at inilipat ito sa ibang bansa,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.47,0:44:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi niya alam kung nasaan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.68,0:44:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano ito posible?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.72,0:44:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The chairman's office\Nmanual na pinamamahalaan ang ledger,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.02,0:44:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,at ibinigay ito sa chairman para suriin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.06,0:44:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang proseso ng laundering ay kumplikado,\Ndahil dumaan sila sa sampung bansa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.73,0:45:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang huling destinasyon ay\Na bangko sa Labuan, Malaysia,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.73,0:45:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit wala ang pera.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.83,0:45:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo akong makita, Chairman Yoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.33,0:45:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka nagdalawang-isip...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.46,0:45:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,para tawagin akong ganyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.09,0:45:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ako dapat?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.42,0:45:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagbago ang mga bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.63,0:45:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi na ako bahagi ng\NQueens o asawa ni Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.55,0:45:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.60,0:45:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,pero sayang naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.60,0:45:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako komportable na pinamumunuan mo pa rin ang aming legal team.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.73,0:45:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre. naiintindihan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.94,0:45:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.57,0:45:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I-drop ang aksyon, na.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.45,0:45:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Magiging tapat ako, dahil parang alam mo ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.62,0:45:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Naghihintay pa rin ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.83,0:45:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Isumite ko ang aking résumé sa\NBaekhwa, Taepung, Hwang & Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.88,0:46:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still negotiating my salary,\Npero hindi madali sa field na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.92,0:46:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang hirap taasan ng sweldo\Nung break na.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.76,0:46:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tulad ng alam mo na,\NI ay hindi nakatanggap ng anumang alimony,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.14,0:46:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya kailangan kong gawin ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.76,0:46:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang buwan lang ang kailangan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.43,0:46:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maari mo ba akong tulungan?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.69,0:46:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So naghahanap ka ng bagong trabaho?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.73,0:46:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama, at tulad ng alam mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.11,0:46:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong access sa legal\Nteam classified na mga dokumento.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.53,0:46:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang dapat ipag-alala.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.12,0:46:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang pumunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.75,0:46:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.04,0:46:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.29,0:46:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba ikaw ang sumundo sa kanya kahapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.63,0:46:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So nasaan siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.85,0:46:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Natatakot ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.68,0:46:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko rin alam.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.85,0:47:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinundo mo siya, pero hindi mo alam kung saan siya nagpunta?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.48,0:47:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eksakto.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.61,0:47:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess hindi niya ako mapagkakatiwalaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.27,0:47:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinuha niya ang kotse at hindi na kumukuha.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.11,0:47:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Pakisabi sa akin...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.78,0:47:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,kung mahanap mo siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.11,0:47:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.86,0:47:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ang tunay na may-ari ng teacup na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.53,0:47:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas nababagay ito sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.24,0:47:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto ko rin ang outfit mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.74,0:47:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukha kang kaakit-akit at eleganteng. Bihira lang yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.74,0:48:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang dahilan kung bakit hindi ako nagbibihis.\Nmadali akong magmukhang glamorous.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.75,0:48:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumunta sa spa bago ko ito isara.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.50,0:48:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayaan mo akong aalagaan ka sa huling pagkakataon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.63,0:48:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Isinasara mo ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.55,0:48:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.55,0:48:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit? Hindi ba naging maganda ang negosyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.23,0:48:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre dapat mo itong isara.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.10,0:48:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.10,0:48:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Matagal mo na yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.56,0:48:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Eksakto.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.82,0:48:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Akala ko tatanda ako habang\Nginagawang mas bata ang iba.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.24,0:48:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi pwedeng mangyari yun.\N- Diba?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.07,0:48:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kapag naupo na ako sa pwesto, gusto kong maglunsad ng cosmetic line...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.08,0:48:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,na may mga produkto mula sa department store.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.04,0:48:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sasabihin mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.12,0:48:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tulad ng Lafayette o Harrods,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.29,0:48:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,dapat nating ibigay ang ating tindahan\Na marangyang reputasyon...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.79,0:48:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.92,0:48:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,, "Kumuha sa pwesto"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.26,0:48:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Saan?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.43,0:48:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba ako ang pumalit sa pwesto ni Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.72,0:48:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukhang masyadong kakaiba\Nung pumalit ako kaagad?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.64,0:49:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon paano ang isang direktor muna?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.40,0:49:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.57,0:49:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Isara ang iyong spa,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.41,0:49:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,impake ang iyong mga gamit, at\Sumali kay Director Jo sa U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.78,0:49:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Masyado kaming mawawala kung mahuli ka nila dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.58,0:49:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang magsimula ng maliit na\Ncosmetic line doon kung gusto mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.21,0:49:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghahanap ako ng ilang investor.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.29,0:49:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maaari mong isara ang iyong negosyo,\Nmove, at magtago,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.04,0:49:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}pero isang bagay na hindi mo\Npalitan ay ang akademya ng iyong anak...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.54,0:49:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kung isa kang magulang.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.60,0:49:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nakatatanda na ang kanyang anak na babae.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.02,0:49:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Naghahanda siyang pumasok sa\Nkolehiyo sa pamamagitan ng pag-aaral sa cello.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.94,0:49:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,kinademanda kita dahil sa panloloko at paglabag sa\Nthe Communications Privacy Act,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.73,0:49:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi nila maipadala sa iyo\Nang mga papel mula nang wala ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.28,0:49:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinanap kita kung saan-saan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.38,0:50:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya mayroon siyang ganito sa lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.54,0:50:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat nakagawa siya ng kopya.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.26,0:50:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.84,0:50:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Soo-cheol, hayaan mong ibunyag ko ang katotohanan...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.60,0:50:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}tungkol sa dati mong asawa, si Cheon Da-hye.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.56,0:50:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baka matakot ka nito nang kaunti.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.52,0:50:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sabi mo magkakaroon ka ng rashes\Neating katabi ng isang matandang babae,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.11,0:50:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}pero kita mo, limang taon akong mas matanda sa iyo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.36,0:50:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Lahat ng tungkol sa aking mga magulang,\Nkanilang kayamanan, at ang aking pag-aaral ay peke.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.70,0:50:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Isa pa. Hindi mo anak si Geon-u.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.79,0:50:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Paano ito naging obvious?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.37,0:50:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mayroon kang matatalas na katangian,\Nhabang ang kay Geon-u ay malambot.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.37,0:50:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Paano ka hindi maghihinala?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.75,0:50:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nalulungkot din akong iwan ka.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.92,0:50:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hindi na ako makakatagpo ng ibang lalaking katulad mo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.22,0:51:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Papakasalan mo ba ako, o hindi?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.34,0:51:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sabi ko hindi.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.72,0:51:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Fine, pero bigyan mo ako ng gloves mo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.86,0:51:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Makulit ka pero clumsy.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.06,0:51:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ano nga ulit ang pangalan ko?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.39,0:51:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Cheon Da-hye.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.77,0:51:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mayaman ka, pero hindi ka masyadong matalino.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.73,0:51:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Maaari mo bang ipangako na hindi kita kailangang pakasalan?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.28,0:51:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Oo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.36,0:51:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nga pala, mainit ba ang muffler na iyon?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.32,0:51:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Dapat nakilala mo ako\Npagkatapos ibigay sa akin ang lahat ng gusto ko.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.14,0:51:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pakibigyan sila ng isang buong palakpakan...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.14,0:51:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}sa pagsisimula nila sa kanilang bagong paglalakbay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.06,0:51:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pareho silang maganda.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.27,0:51:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hey.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.40,0:51:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Huwag mo akong gawing frustrated.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.40,0:51:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nainis ako nang\NHae-in ay tumangging makinig sa akin,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.28,0:52:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}at pinili ang lalaking iyon sa halip.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.99,0:52:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mas mabuting akitin mo si Soo-cheol\Nand na pakasalan siya kaagad.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.57,0:52:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sige.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.99,0:52:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Huwag mong sabihin sa kanya ang tunay mong pangalan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.62,0:52:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gumamit ng peke.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.91,0:52:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi, gagamitin ko ang aking tunay na pangalan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.33,0:52:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nga pala, nasaan siya?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.00,0:52:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nandiyan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.38,0:52:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Huwag na kayong magpakasal.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.84,0:52:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Napaka-hectic.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.05,0:52:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Hindi.\N- Alam ko.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.09,0:52:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Iyan ang iyakin na kilala ko?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.47,0:52:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ang tangkad niya... Type ko lang.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.43,0:52:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi, sa likod niya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.69,0:52:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ang tanga. Hindi siya nagbago.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.69,0:52:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Gosh.\N- Anyway, kumain ka na, since nandito ka pa rin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.49,0:52:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Paalam.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.55,0:53:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Sir.\N- Natutuwa akong makita ka.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.01,0:53:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Saan ka nanggaling? Hinanap kita.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.09,0:53:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Natutuwa akong nandito ka.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.43,0:53:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kumain ka na.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.72,0:53:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ngunit hindi mo ako nakilala.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.15,0:53:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kumusta.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.49,0:53:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ang pangalan ko ay Cheon Da-hye.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.87,0:53:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}"Cheon Da-hye"?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.91,0:53:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Magandang pangalan iyon,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.08,0:53:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}at gayundin ang iyong mukha.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.50,0:53:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nakikita ko.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.63,0:53:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi ka pa kumakain.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.67,0:53:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Tingnan natin...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.13,0:53:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kalimutan mo ako,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.97,0:53:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}tulad ng mayroon ka sa nakaraan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.85,0:53:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Geon-u din.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.22,0:53:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hindi ito magiging mahirap. Hindi ka naman ganoon kaliwanag.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.82,0:54:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.12,0:54:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka umiiyak?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.04,0:54:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan ko makikita si Da-hye?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.63,0:54:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.96,0:54:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinuha niya ang lahat at\Nmarahil nagtago.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.22,0:54:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, nagkakamali ka. May nakalimutan siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.34,0:54:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.18,0:54:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.68,0:54:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nandito pa rin ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.94,0:54:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinasabi niya noon...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.40,0:54:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ang pinakamahalagang tao,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.73,0:54:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so saan siya nagpunta matapos akong iwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.23,0:55:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, gising ka na ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.03,0:55:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta, gising ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.32,0:55:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.17,0:55:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo ito, Geon-u.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.63,0:55:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang paborito kong manika.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.64,0:55:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit ano ang silbi ng paggawa nito ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.35,0:55:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Binaliktad na ang mga talahanayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.06,0:55:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ibabalik ko silang muli.\N- Pero paano?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.98,0:56:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi nakamit ni Eun-sung ang kanyang ginawang legal, at papatunayan ko iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.19,0:56:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.35,0:56:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin natin na ito ay labag sa batas\Nand nasa amin ang lahat ng patunay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.78,0:56:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagsampa ng demanda, pagdalo sa mga pagsubok,\Isusumbong siya muli para sa mga stock...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.67,0:56:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aabutin ito ng hindi bababa sa limang taon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.49,0:56:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sigurado ka ba?\N- Mag-shortcut ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.17,0:56:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Alin ang?\N- Panloloko sa pamumuhunan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.93,0:56:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagplano siya ng $2 bilyong pandaraya sa pamumuhunan...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.83,0:56:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,mula sa simula, at naakit ang pamilya...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.70,0:56:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,na may bagong ideya sa negosyo para nakawin ang kanilang mga stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.08,0:56:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Babawiin nila ang kanilang pansamantalang\Nseizure kung mapatunayan ko ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.38,0:56:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,pero ang pinakamahalaga, mawawalan siya ng kapangyarihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.76,0:56:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano ang mga stock?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.80,0:56:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa kanya pa rin ang stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.22,0:56:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Gagamitin ko ang parehong taktika na ginawa niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.19,0:56:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Anong ginagawa mo?\N- Marami lang akong oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.85,0:56:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat bigyan nila tayo ng mga bagong\Nposisyon. Hindi ako mapakali dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.69,0:56:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Masama ang pakiramdam ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.23,0:56:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kailanman tinanggihan ang tawag ni Mr. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.40,0:56:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang sumama.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.45,0:56:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas mainam na putulin kaagad ang mga relasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.20,0:56:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba kayo medyo close ni Ms. Hong, pero?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.64,0:56:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.70,0:57:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.33,0:57:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba kung bakit abstract nouns ang "friendship"\Nand "loyalty"?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.67,0:57:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil wala sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.21,0:57:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Secretary Na at Ms. Hong ay hindi\Nmumukhang magkaugnay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.30,0:57:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagpapahinga siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.80,0:57:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mananatili siya sa isang farm kasama ang kanyang anak.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.93,0:57:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- At si Mr. Baek?\N- Wala siyang trabaho ngayon,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.14,0:57:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya nagsusulat siya ng résumé...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.43,0:57:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,at dumalo rin sa mga interbyu sa trabaho.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.06,0:57:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayoko marinig!\NBring out the executives!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.90,0:57:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Arestuhin sila!\N- Arestuhin sila!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.03,0:57:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hinihiling namin sa Queens\Nresolve itong investment fraud!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.82,0:57:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, anong plano mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.70,0:57:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukhang galit na galit sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.70,0:57:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakampi rin nila ang legal director!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.49,0:57:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagpakasal ka sa pamilyang iyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.95,0:57:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, nagkakamali ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.00,0:57:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay tinanggal sa trabaho at bahay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.08,0:57:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala siyang anumang impluwensya.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.38,0:57:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.55,0:57:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumunta ako dito para pakinggan ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.76,0:57:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasabi na namin ang aming kwento.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.51,0:57:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Naakit kami ng mga Reyna sa pamamagitan ng pag-aalok\Nbabayaran ng limang beses sa presyo sa merkado.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.60,0:58:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos nahulog ang resort\Ncomplex project,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.01,0:58:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,at doble lang ang inaalok?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.23,0:58:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Palagay ko nagkaroon ng double contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.65,0:58:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tingnan ko ang kontrata, at...\N- Huwag kang maging absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.79,0:58:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Attorney Hwang{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.38,0:58:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Bank President Gu Bon-jun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.23,0:58:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Assemblyman Han{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.35,0:58:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Direktor Ryu{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.65,0:58:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nasa isang meeting ako. Tatawagan ulit kita.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.70,0:59:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.20,0:59:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.04,0:59:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagtatrabaho ka rin tuwing weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.41,0:59:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.50,0:59:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang mga damo ay hindi tumitigil sa paglaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.17,0:59:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala na tayong mahihiling pa...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.46,0:59:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,kaysa sa ilang malamig na {\i1}makgeolli{\i0} at {\i1}pajeon...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.76,0:59:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,pagkatapos ng aming trabaho sa umaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.58,0:59:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.59,0:59:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Namumuhay ka ng magandang buhay na napapaligiran ng kalikasan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.56,0:59:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nainggit ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.52,0:59:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.69,0:59:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatawa ang mga tao kung\Nrinig nila na mayamang pamilya...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.77,0:59:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,ay naiinggit sa ilang magsasaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.82,0:59:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya nga pala, hindi ako sigurado kung ang\Nyou ay nagkaroon ng {\i1}makgeolli{\i0} dati.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.07,0:59:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagawa ko minsan,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.99,0:59:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,out of curiosity, back in college 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.08,0:59:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon dapat mayroon ka ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.63,0:59:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.71,0:59:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dito.\N- Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.17,0:59:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.63,1:00:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.59,1:00:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.97,1:00:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan nating gumawa ng toast, ngunit ano ang dapat nating sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.98,1:00:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta naman ang "Pinakamahalaga ang kalusugan"?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.52,1:00:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi natin masasabi iyan,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.15,1:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil ang kanyang ama ay nakaratay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.03,1:00:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon paano kung...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.07,1:00:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"Napakagandang makita ka"?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.99,1:00:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi rin gagana yan,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.78,1:00:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,mula sa kanilang kasalukuyang sitwasyon...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.62,1:00:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi ba napakaganda.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.00,1:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Basta...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.96,1:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,kumakat ang aming salamin.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.96,1:00:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.90,1:00:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.52,1:00:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.98,1:01:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.24,1:01:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tayo...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.36,1:01:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Inom pa tayo ng kaunti.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.45,1:01:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang tanga. Dapat umuwi na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.12,1:01:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi na ako babalik doon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.62,1:01:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus. Hindi ba komportable ang aming tahanan?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.54,1:01:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaminin ko ito ay mas malabo kaysa sa...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.54,1:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi kaya!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.55,1:01:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bilang ulo ng aking pamilya,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.97,1:01:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat ko silang aliwin at sabihin...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.89,1:01:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,, maayos ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.27,1:01:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mawawala ang mga bagay-bagay,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.64,1:01:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,at dapat na tayong umuwi bukas,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.27,1:01:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi ko masabi sa ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.23,1:01:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahihiya akong harapin sila.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.28,1:01:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayoko rin umuwi.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.65,1:01:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, mahal.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.28,1:01:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanina ngayon,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.41,1:01:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinawagan ko ang aking pinakamalapit na kaibigan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.12,1:01:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pa ako humingi ng ganyang pabor dati,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.58,1:02:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,pero humingi ako sa kanya ng\N$20,000 lang, dahil wala kaming pera.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.17,1:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,At?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.59,1:02:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi niya hindi.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.76,1:02:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-aalangan siyang bigyan ako ng pera,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.97,1:02:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil kami ay tanungin\Nng prosekusyon sa lalong madaling panahon,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.30,1:02:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,at hinahanap tayo ng mga reporter.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.18,1:02:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.47,1:02:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Natulala ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.18,1:02:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiintindihan ko kung bakit ka natulala,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.19,1:02:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil siya ang pinakamalapit mong kaibigan.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.23,1:02:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi dahil sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.15,1:02:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa katotohanan na wala man lang akong $20,000.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.49,1:02:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumirma ako kamakailan ng buwis\Ninvoice na nagkakahalaga ng $45.6 milyon,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.03,1:02:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,pero ngayon wala pa akong $20,000 sa bulsa ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.66,1:02:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel utterly pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.09,1:02:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.92,1:02:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung maaaliw ka ba nito.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.41,1:02:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.47,1:02:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero walang ginagawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.18,1:02:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang sinuman ang may ganoong karami sa kanilang mga bulsa.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.89,1:02:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Baek! Alam kong nagsisinungaling ka\Npara lang gumaan ang pakiramdam ko!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.48,1:03:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.61,1:03:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala pa akong ganyan dati!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.61,1:03:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sige.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.66,1:03:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mag-uusap ulit tayo mamaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.45,1:03:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tita Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.66,1:03:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.79,1:03:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Balita ko nasa adobo ka ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.34,1:03:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Medyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.96,1:03:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang mahabang kwento.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.96,1:03:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Balita ko sikreto na nandito ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.30,1:03:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala. Walang makakarinig ng pagsilip mula sa ating dulo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.55,1:03:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ang ating wakas"?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.59,1:03:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yongdu-ri Internet Café.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.93,1:03:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Medyo pinapatakbo ko ang lugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.47,1:03:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.93,1:03:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.81,1:03:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.89,1:04:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, gising na siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.35,1:04:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in.\N- Okay ka lang, Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.23,1:04:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumain ka ng tubig, Sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.23,1:04:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka ba dapat pumunta sa ospital?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.19,1:04:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.24,1:04:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.28,1:04:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako makatulog ng maayos\Ngabi, kaya nahihilo ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.48,1:04:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Iniinom mo ba ang iyong gamot?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.49,1:04:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong gamot? May sakit ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.16,1:04:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Para ito sa anemia ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.27,1:04:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,May anemia ka?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.33,1:04:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang iyong mga resulta ng checkup ay hindi kailanman nagpakita na.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.54,1:04:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaano ito kalala?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.54,1:04:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, huwag kang masyadong madrama.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.67,1:04:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,anemic din ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.63,1:04:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahihilo din ako, since\NI hindi rin masyadong makatulog.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.38,1:04:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi rin maganda si Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.30,1:04:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Lahat tayo naghihirap dito.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.77,1:05:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit na, hindi normal ang mahimatay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.52,1:05:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tag kasama si Hyun-woo sa Seoul\Nbukas at bumisita sa ospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.36,1:05:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, gagawin ko iyan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.82,1:05:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Pagod na ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.37,1:05:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ang harsh mo kay Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.78,1:05:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kailan ako?\N- May sakit siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.62,1:05:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nawalan siya ng malay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.58,1:05:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,, Kahit isang estranghero ay mag-aalala.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.21,1:05:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang. Ang kanyang biyenan...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.13,1:05:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, ang kanyang dating biyenan\Nalagang mabuti pa rin siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.72,1:05:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ba nakita?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.01,1:05:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi nag-atubili si Hae-in na sundin siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.47,1:05:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagawa na rin ba niya sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.51,1:05:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa, sa tingin mo ba\Nalam mo ang lahat tungkol kay Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.22,1:05:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, siyempre hindi, at hindi na kailangan iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.52,1:05:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.86,1:05:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.61,1:05:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.03,1:05:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.03,1:05:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang problema mo?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.91,1:06:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Itigil ang pagtawag sa pangalan ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.53,1:06:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in ay...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.62,1:06:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.00,1:06:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do me this favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.04,1:06:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tratuhin mo siya ng mabuti, para hindi ka magsisi sa huli.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.55,1:06:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Pakiusap.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.17,1:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ako magsisisi?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.72,1:06:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako gumagawa ng mga bagay na pinagsisisihan ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.35,1:06:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, nakakainis.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.73,1:06:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Magiging heartbroken siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.02,1:06:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.84,1:07:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit walang katulad sa kanya ang mga ex ko?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.11,1:07:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinawagan ko ang iyong doktor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.69,1:07:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Makikita mo siya bukas.\N- Umupo ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.70,1:07:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano na ang ginawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.08,1:07:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.95,1:07:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ilang araw, natabunan siya ng mga itlog.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.44,1:07:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kasunduan sa Pagbili ng Lupa{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.52,1:07:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Secretary Na?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.78,1:07:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mag-meeting tayo sa pantry ng opisina.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.07,1:07:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Okay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.99,1:08:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sa tingin ko ay nagkikita na siya...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.62,1:08:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}sa mga land protesters na iyon.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.24,1:08:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sige.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.50,1:08:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mag-uusap ulit tayo mamaya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.58,1:08:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakipag-ugnayan ka ba sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.92,1:08:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo sa akin kung gaano mo nalaman...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.92,1:08:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,sa likod ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.67,1:08:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang iyong karaniwang panloloko sa real-estate-investment.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.89,1:08:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Binili ng isang broker ang lupa\Nin tanong mula sa mga may-ari,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.51,1:08:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,at inaalok ng limang beses sa presyo sa merkado.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.72,1:08:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay pumirma sila ng kontrata sa\NQueens sa isang-katlo ng presyong iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.70,1:08:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang dobleng kontrata?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.65,1:08:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ay sadyang panloloko.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.19,1:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan nating patunayan iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.40,1:08:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,At ang broker? Nabanggit mo ang isa.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.23,1:08:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasa Korea ba siya? Nakatakas na ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.82,1:08:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Paradise Land, Ltd.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.87,1:08:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nawala nga siya,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.92,1:08:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}pero ikakasal na siya ngayong weekend.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.05,1:09:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sa tingin ko ay plano niyang lumipad\Nout kaagad pagkatapos,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.18,1:09:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi niya magagawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.80,1:09:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinihikayat ko ang mga may-ari ng lupa na magdemanda,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.51,1:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,at ilagay siya sa No-Fly List ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.77,1:09:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mawawala ang mga bagay kapag nahuli na natin siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.02,1:09:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.48,1:09:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit hindi mo dapat alalahanin ang iyong sarili...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.77,1:09:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,sa bagay na ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.32,1:09:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi? Bakit hindi ako dapat?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.78,1:09:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.78,1:09:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ay namamatay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.57,1:09:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasira ang pamilya namin.\NKami ay dumi-dukha at walang tirahan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.33,1:09:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Na-coma ang lolo ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.95,1:09:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumakbo si Da-hye.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.00,1:09:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala na si Soo-cheol,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.41,1:09:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,pero ang pinakamasama...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.17,1:09:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,nasa hometown ba ako ng ex-husband ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.80,1:09:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ba...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.46,1:09:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,nakakatakot?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.55,1:09:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,May kailangan akong gawin...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.30,1:09:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,sa sitwasyong ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.55,1:09:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngayon, binigyan ko pa ang sarili ko ng\Ninjection na magpapalaki sa WBC ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.19,1:09:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayokong maupo.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.72,1:09:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko. Maganda ang ginawa mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.10,1:09:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, makakabangon na ako...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.81,1:09:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,kung ipagpapatuloy ko ito,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.98,1:10:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,at makakaalis ka\N ako nang hindi nababahala.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.61,1:10:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay maghihiwalay na tayo ng landas...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.07,1:10:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,parang totoong hiwalay na mag-asawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.20,1:10:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ang layunin ko,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.08,1:10:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,upang makipaghiwalay sa iyo para sa kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.50,1:10:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisimulan kong ibahagi...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.59,1:10:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,lahat ng kasama mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.26,1:10:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Gawin natin ang lahat ng ating makakaya,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.72,1:10:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,basta kaya ng katawan mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.76,1:10:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat mong maabot ang iyong layunin...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.89,1:10:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,sa lalong madaling panahon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.89,1:10:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.59,1:11:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}ID Card\NHong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.31,1:12:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sungmin University Medical Center\NHong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.28,1:12:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Sungmin University Medical Center{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.90,1:12:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Magpaparada ako at aakyat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.87,1:12:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.99,1:12:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ikaw ba ang pasyente?\NYes{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.91,1:12:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Muling Mag-isyu ng Mga Nakaraang Dokumento{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.41,1:12:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Naglo-load{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.17,1:12:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Referral{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.81,1:12:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ang mga tumor cell ay kumalat sa pagitan ng cranial nerves{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.06,1:12:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hindi matagumpay ang paggamot dahil sa mababang WBC{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.07,1:12:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Average na tinantyang buhay\Neexpectancy na tatlong buwan{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.27,1:13:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Teka! ano pangalan mo
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.78,1:13:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maging ang direktor ng ospital\Ntumangging sabihin sa akin ang iyong pangalan,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.24,1:13:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit sa wakas ay makikilala na rin kita.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.78,1:13:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Isinulat mo ang diagnosis na ito,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.57,1:13:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya sabihin mo sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.53,1:13:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano ko maililigtas si Hong Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.83,1:13:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon lang ang kailangan kong malaman.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.97,1:14:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nandito? Pupunta ako sa opisina ng doktor.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.21,1:14:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumawag ang doktor.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.56,1:14:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumating si Eun-sung.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.41,1:14:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pasensya na.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.58,1:14:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi ka niya pamilya o tagapag-alaga,\Nkaya hindi ko obligado na sabihin sa iyo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.54,1:14:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Wala akong masabi.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.58,1:14:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Talaga?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.58,1:14:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sasabihin mo ba sa akin kung magiging guardian niya ako?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.17,1:14:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Supermarket{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.18,1:14:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.59,1:14:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka ba nagugutom?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.30,1:14:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Makiupo dito.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.60,1:14:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.29,1:14:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita mo...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.38,1:14:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.40,1:14:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinahiram sa akin ng isang matandang babae ang kanyang panyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.23,1:14:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong matandang babae?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.49,1:14:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So... Siya...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.11,1:15:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,May anak siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.24,1:15:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko, at ang pangalan niya ay...?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.99,1:15:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako sigurado.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.00,1:15:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ordinaryo ang itsura niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.17,1:15:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamukha niya si Leslie Cheung.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.92,1:15:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa aming kapitbahayan?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.00,1:15:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, duda ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.09,1:15:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda rin ang boses niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.67,1:15:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tulad ng isang mang-aawit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.05,1:15:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang lalaking kamukha ni Leslie Cheung\Nand ay may boses ng isang mang-aawit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.01,1:15:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa aming kapitbahayan?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.27,1:15:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Maliban na lang kung multo,\NI'm afraid na nagkakamali ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.56,1:15:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.44,1:15:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Magkamukha sila.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.74,1:15:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.87,1:15:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nandito na sila.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.37,1:15:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gutom ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.66,1:15:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oo.\N- Okay, kain na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.17,1:15:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Magandang timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.42,1:15:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Handa na ang hapunan. Tara kain na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.05,1:15:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang hapunan?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.05,1:15:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumawa ako ng nilagang maikling ribs.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.42,1:15:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Braised short ribs?\N- Ang sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.97,1:16:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sana okay lang.\N- Nagdagdag ka rin ba ng chestnuts?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.12,1:16:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ba...?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.87,1:16:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Binisita ka ba ni Grace?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.58,1:16:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi mo ba sa kanya na hindi?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.96,1:16:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, ginawa ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.29,1:16:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Magaling. Kailangan niyang malaman ang kanyang lugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.80,1:16:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Magpadala ng press release at sabihing\NI'll take over the department store.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.97,1:16:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, iyon ang pwesto ni Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.06,1:16:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong sinasabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.06,1:16:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Babalik siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.81,1:16:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako na ang bahala dito.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.15,1:16:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya ganun kadaling mamatay.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.69,1:16:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Aalagaan ko siya ng husto,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.53,1:17:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya nabubuhay siya, ngunit nananatiling walang malay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.28,1:17:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Basta siya ay coma,\NI'm in charge of 21% of the stocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.79,1:17:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiintindihan mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.30,1:17:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Alisin mo ako sa listahan ng no-fly\NIto lang ang iyong babala{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.00,1:18:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mr. Yoon Eun-sung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.88,1:18:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.72,1:18:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi ko sayo.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.84,1:18:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kami pareho ng layunin.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.47,1:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ang chairman?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.64,1:18:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hindi mo dapat gawin ito.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.31,1:18:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano kung mamatay siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.23,1:18:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon hindi ito maaaring makatulong.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.85,1:18:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.85,1:18:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Aalis na ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.86,1:19:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan ka pupunta nito\Nlate? Hapunan na natin.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.58,1:19:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pupunta lang ako...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.20,1:19:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa paglalakad.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.83,1:20:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Palagay ko malapit na si Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.79,1:20:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.25,1:20:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.42,1:20:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat tayong maghintay at kumain kasama siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.05,1:20:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sige, kung ganoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.76,1:20:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag masyadong lumayo, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.35,1:20:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.48,1:21:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.06,1:21:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.85,1:21:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.65,1:22:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Pyeon Seong-uk?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.40,1:22:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinanap kita.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.11,1:22:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko. ako dapat...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.03,1:22:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,sa Boracay ngayon pagkatapos ng kasal ko,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.45,1:22:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit ang mga bagay ay naging\Nkomplikado, salamat sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.41,1:22:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakuha mo ba ang text ko?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.79,1:22:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagreply ako at sinabing...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.79,1:22:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,dapat nating harapin ito nang legal,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.08,1:22:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil hindi ko ibababa ang suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.11,1:23:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Eksakto.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.90,1:23:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang katotohanang pinanatili mo pa rin\Nito sa lahat ng mga taon na ito ay nangangahulugan na...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.57,1:24:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi mo siya maalis sa isip mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.07,1:24:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Siguradong napakaganda niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.95,1:24:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.58,1:24:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi naman sa ganun.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.83,1:24:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko na maalala...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.04,1:24:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,kung ang tao ay lalaki, babae,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.83,1:24:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,isang guro, isang estudyante,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.17,1:24:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,o isang security guard. Wala akong maalala.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.76,1:24:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Malapit na iyon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.43,1:24:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay matalas, tulad ng dapat na isang CEO.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.30,1:24:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano niya ito makukuha kaagad?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.72,1:24:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa sandaling makita niya ito, sinabi ng kanyang bituka na pag-aari ito ng isang babae.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.43,1:24:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Malapit na.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.94,1:24:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Muntik na akong mahuli.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.15,1:24:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Diba sabi mo...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.52,1:24:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,hinanap mo ang buong paaralan...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.11,1:24:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa babaeng iyon, parang\Nang prinsipe mula sa "Cinderella"?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.49,1:24:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginawa ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.53,1:24:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda talaga siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.88,1:24:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Naaalala mo pa ba yun?\N- Vividly.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.84,1:24:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ang ideal type ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.34,1:24:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo ba makikilala mo siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.57,1:25:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Agad-agad.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.63,1:25:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong huli na ang lahat,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.22,1:25:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,pero siguro siya ang destiny mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.60,1:25:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where she is, and what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.03,1:25:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Reyna ng Luha{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.18,1:25:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- {\i1}Anong kahihiyan ang nakuha niya?\N- Papatayin kita!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.81,1:25:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Kahit na, pareho pa rin sana ang pipiliin ko.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.86,1:26:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Dapat alam mo na ngayon,\NI gawin ang lahat ng gusto kong gawin.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.36,1:26:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Walang halagang pera ang makakabili ng karanasang ito.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.40,1:26:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}- Sabi mo hawakan ko!\N- Nepotism?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.28,1:26:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Aalis ba siya? Gusto ba niyang tumira kasama ka?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.87,1:26:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Hindi pwede. Nagseselos ba siya?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.66,1:26:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Sa narinig ko, nagkukunwaring ignorante siya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.45,1:26:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}May kakayahan akong magbunyag ng mga katotohanan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.33,1:26:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}May kailangan akong gawin.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.13,1:26:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Sinusubukan mo talaga ang pasensya ko,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.00,1:26:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}kaya mawala ka na lang.{\i0}
